; Disposable WB 3.1 Which ALL status probe. Output is retained in S:Shell-Startup.
FailAt 20
Path C:
Echo "BEGIN" >S:Shell-Startup
Resident >NIL: C:Execute PURE
C:Which Execute ALL >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "ALL RC=$RC RESULT2=$Result2" >>S:Shell-Startup
Resident >NIL: Execute REMOVE
Echo "END" >>S:Shell-Startup
EndCLI >NIL:
